/**
 * `RestaurantArenaLayout.scale` for the canvas this paint is sizing for —
 * 1 at the 520×740 baseline and on any smaller (compact) canvas, up to
 * `ARENA_MAX_SCALE` on a big desktop window. Every font size and every bit
