/**
 * Every repaint from outside a drag goes through here. A tick, a worker
 * status push or a state patch can land at any moment, including the moment
 * the player has a staff token in hand — and a repaint mid-drag destroys
 * the token being dragged, so the figure jumps back to its old station and
 * the drop is lost. The gate holds one repaint back for the length of the
 * drag and hands it over when the drag ends.
 */
private requestRepaint(): void {
  if (this.repaintGate.requestPaint()) this.paint();
